 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "To The Witch Who Forgot The Bird"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "새를 잊은 마녀에게"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "He wanted to live. He wanted to live meaningfully.\nHe didn’t want to ruin his life by making rash choices.\nWhat on earth should he do? How should he be free… … .\n\n‘There are too many people here who want to manipulate me as they please.’\nIf there’s something you want, you have to fight for it.\n‘It doesn’t matter who it is. If it’s a goddess, I’ll kill her. If it’s heaven, I’ll tear it apart.’\nIf there’s something you long for, you have to face it.\n‘I can do it.’\nRather than living your whole life tied up like a dog, you have to risk death and break the leash.\n\nThat’s what you taught me.\nSo Victoria.\n“Just be free.”"
  },
